Fix command injection in runReport (CWE-78)

The report op passed the report name from the request into a shell command
string and ran it with child_process.execSync, so a name containing shell
metacharacters ran arbitrary commands as the service user. runReport now
matches the name against the two reports it supports and produces them
in-process: there is no command string and no shell, so no request input
reaches a command interpreter.
